---
import SiteLayout from '../../components/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import SoftCta from '../../components/SoftCta.astro';

const steps = [
  ['Understanding', 'Grief as a process, not an isolated feeling; the myths, set down.'],
  ['Meeting the mind', 'The guilt and regret that quietly stop the flow, truly acknowledged.'],
  ['Somatic Vocal Healing', 'The body and voice as an accessible, reliable way to let grief move.'],
  ['Integration', 'Carrying it into your own life, in your own way, at your own pace.'],
];
---

<SiteLayout
  title="The Grief Course — with Daniela Hess & Jacob — Songdance"
  description="Because no one taught you how to grieve. A way to be with grief, consciously and kindly, led by Daniela Hess and Jacob Vermeulen. 4 sessions, lifetime access, €99."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="With Daniela &amp; Jacob"
    title="The Grief Course"
    lede="Because no one taught you how to grieve."
  >
    <div class="sd-pagehero-actions">
      <a href="/contact" class="sd-btn sd-btn-primary">Start now — €99</a>
    </div>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="sd-section sd-prose">
    <div class="sd-prose-inner">
      <p>
        Grief is a natural response to change, and most of us are handed no map for it. When we
        don’t know how to grieve, we tend to reach for whatever numbs — and the numbing becomes its
        own problem. This course offers something else: a way to be <em>with</em> grief, consciously
        and kindly.
      </p>
      <p>
        Led by <strong>Daniela Hess and Jacob Vermeulen</strong>, who between them bring decades of
        grief work. Grief isn’t something to “get over” — that’s one of the myths we’ll set down
        together. It’s something to honour, integrate, and live alongside.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sd-section sd-modules-section">
    <div class="sd-prose-inner">
      <h2 class="sd-prose-h">A reliable four-step process</h2>
      <ol class="sd-modules">
        {steps.map(([t, d], i) => (
          <li class="sd-module">
            <span class="sd-module-n">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="sd-module-t">{t}</h3>
              <p class="sd-module-d">{d}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sd-section sd-prose sd-prose--feature">
    <div class="sd-prose-inner">
      <h2 class="sd-prose-h">Where there is change, there is grief</h2>
      <p>
        Big “G” and small “g”: a death, a divorce, a pet, a friendship, a job, an empty nest. The
        principles apply to all of it.
      </p>
      <p class="sd-prose-note">4 sessions × 120 minutes · lifetime access · €99 · start anytime.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SoftCta
    text="Curious how the sounding part feels?"
    ctaLabel="Sit in on a live session — 9€"
    ctaHref="/session"
  />
</SiteLayout>
